/* ==================================================================================
   SerialTool Classic Theme (S-060)
   ==================================================================================
   [Color Palette Reference]

   1. Backgrounds
      - BG Panel/Main:      #d4d0c8 (Window, Widget, Tab Selected, Button face)
      - BG Input/Base:      #ffffff (Text inputs, lists, tables)
      - BG Hover:           #c8c4bc (Button/Tab hover - darker face)
      - BG Pressed:         #b8b4ac (Button/Menu pressed)
      - BG Disabled:        #cac6be

   2. Foregrounds (Text)
      - Text Main:          #000000
      - Text Dim/Hint:      #505050
      - Text Disabled:      #6d6d6d
      - Text Inverted:      #ffffff

   3. Borders & Separators
      - Border Main:        #707070
      - Border Disabled:    #a8a4a0
      - Border Focus:       #000080 (Navy Accent)

   4. Selections
      - Selection BG:       #000080 (Navy)
      - Selection Text:     #ffffff

   5. Accents & States
      - Primary (Navy):     #000080 (Focus, Active Tab, Links, Section Title)
      - Success (Green):    #4CAF50 (Connect, Start) - shared with light theme family
      - Danger  (Red):      #F44336 (Error, Stop, Delete) - shared with light theme family
      - Warning (Orange):   #FFC107 (Pause, Warning) - shared with light theme family

   6. Component Specific
      - Hover Overlay:      Darken panel by ~8% (#c8c4bc)
      - Pressed Overlay:    Darken panel by ~16% (#b8b4ac)
      - Tooltip:            #ffffe1 bg (classic pale-yellow), #000000 text, #707070 border

   [Contrast verification — 2026-08-22, S-060, WCAG relative-luminance formula
    (script pattern: tasks/S-022-theme-contrast-hardcoded-colors.md)]
      #000000 on #d4d0c8 (body text / panel)      = 13.656 : 1  (>= 4.5 required)
      #000000 on #ffffff (body text / input)      = 21.000 : 1  (>= 4.5 required)
      #505050 on #d4d0c8 (hint/dim text / panel)  =  5.243 : 1  (>= 4.5 required)
      #505050 on #ffffff (hint/dim text / input)  =  8.063 : 1  (>= 4.5 required)
      #6d6d6d on #d4d0c8 (disabled text / panel)  =  3.365 : 1  (>= 3.0 required)
      #6d6d6d on #ffffff (disabled text / input)  =  5.174 : 1  (>= 3.0 required)
      #707070 on #d4d0c8 (border / panel)         =  3.220 : 1  (>= 3.0 required)
      #707070 on #ffffff (border / input)         =  4.952 : 1  (>= 3.0 required)
      #ffffff on #000080 (selection text / navy)  = 16.010 : 1  (>= 4.5 required)
      #000080 on #d4d0c8 (accent text / panel)    = 10.411 : 1  (>= 4.5 required)
      #1b5e20 on #d4d0c8 (connected status label) =  5.117 : 1  (>= 4.5 required)
      #616161 on #d4d0c8 (disconnected status)    =  4.027 : 1  (>= 4.5 required)
      #b71c1c on #ffcdd2 (recording text/bg)      =  4.666 : 1  (>= 4.5 required)
    NOTE: 지침 초안의 테두리 색 #808080은 #d4d0c8 배경에서 2.568:1로 3:1 미달이라
    #707070로 상향했다 (하위 모델 조정, S-035 선례와 동일 절차). 3D 베벨 장식색
    (#ffffff/#404040 느낌의 밝은/어두운 면)은 이 파일에서 텍스트/의미 전달 목적이
    아니므로 별도 대비 기준을 적용하지 않았다 - 별도 베벨 규칙은 도입하지 않음
    (기존 3테마에도 3D 베벨 셀렉터가 없어 대칭 유지를 위해 생략).
   ================================================================================== */

/* Global Settings */
QWidget {
    background-color: #d4d0c8;
    color: #000000;
    selection-background-color: #000080;
    selection-color: #ffffff;
}

QToolTip {
    background-color: #ffffe1;
    color: #000000;
    border-color: #707070;
}

/* MainWindow */
QMainWindow {
    background-color: #d4d0c8;
}

QMainWindow::separator {
    background-color: #707070;
}

QMainWindow::separator:hover {
    background-color: #505050;
}

/* QTabWidget */
QTabWidget::pane {
    border-color: #707070;
    background-color: #d4d0c8;
}

QTabBar::tab {
    background-color: #d4d0c8;
    color: #505050;
    border-color: #707070;
}

QTabBar::tab:selected {
    background-color: #d4d0c8;
    color: #000000;
    border-bottom-color: #000080;
}

QTabBar::tab:hover {
    background-color: #c8c4bc;
    color: #000000;
}

QTabBar::close-button {
    image: url(resources/icons/light/close_light.svg);
}

QTabBar::close-button:hover {
    background-color: #b8b4ac;
}

/* QPushButton */
QPushButton {
    background-color: #d4d0c8;
    border-color: #707070;
    color: #000000;
}

QPushButton:hover {
    background-color: #c8c4bc;
    border-color: #505050;
}

QPushButton:pressed {
    background-color: #b8b4ac;
    color: #000000;
}

QPushButton:checked {
    background-color: #000080;
    border-color: #000080;
    color: #ffffff;
}

QPushButton:disabled {
    background-color: #cac6be;
    color: #6d6d6d;
    border-color: #a8a4a0;
}

/* Icons (classic 아이콘 디렉터리 없음 - light 아이콘 재사용, ThemeResourceLoader.get_icon()도
   동일하게 classic -> light 폴백한다) */
QPushButton#add_row_btn { qproperty-icon: url(resources/icons/light/add_light.svg); }
QPushButton#remove_row_btn { qproperty-icon: url(resources/icons/light/delete_light.svg); }
QPushButton#up_row_btn { qproperty-icon: url(resources/icons/light/up_light.svg); }
QPushButton#down_row_btn { qproperty-icon: url(resources/icons/light/down_light.svg); }
QPushButton#data_log_search_prev_btn { qproperty-icon: url(resources/icons/light/find_prev_light.svg); }
QPushButton#data_log_search_next_btn { qproperty-icon: url(resources/icons/light/find_next_light.svg); }

/* Inputs */
QLineEdit, QTextEdit, QPlainTextEdit, QSmartTextEdit, QSmartListView {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-color: #707070;
    color: #000000;
    selection-background-color: #000080;
    selection-color: #ffffff;
}

QLineEdit:focus, QTextEdit:focus, QPlainTextEdit:focus, QSmartTextEdit:focus, QSmartListView:focus {
    border-color: #000080;
}

QLineEdit:disabled, QTextEdit:disabled, QPlainTextEdit:disabled, QSmartTextEdit:disabled, QSmartListView:disabled {
    background-color: #cac6be;
    color: #6d6d6d;
}

/* QSmartTextEdit Properties */
QSmartTextEdit {
    qproperty-lineNumberBackgroundColor: #cac6be;
    qproperty-lineNumberColor: #505050;
    qproperty-currentLineColor: #e4e0d8;
}

/* QComboBox */
QComboBox {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-color: #707070;
    color: #000000;
}

QComboBox:hover {
    background-color: #f0f0e8;
}

QComboBox:on {
    border-color: #000080;
}

QComboBox::down-arrow {
    image: url(resources/icons/light/arrow_down_light.svg);
}

QComboBox QAbstractItemView {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-color: #707070;
    selection-background-color: #000080;
    selection-color: #ffffff;
}

/* QProgressBar */
QProgressBar {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-color: #707070;
    color: #000000;
}

QProgressBar::chunk {
    background-color: #000080;
}

/* QScrollBar */
QScrollBar:vertical, QScrollBar:horizontal {
    background-color: #cac6be;
}

QScrollBar::handle:vertical, QScrollBar::handle:horizontal {
    background-color: #707070;
}

QScrollBar::handle:vertical:hover, QScrollBar::handle:horizontal:hover {
    background-color: #505050;
}

/* Views */
QTableView, QListView, QTreeWidget, QSmartListView {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-color: #707070;
    gridline-color: #c0bcb4;
    selection-background-color: #000080;
    selection-color: #ffffff;
    color: #000000;
}

QHeaderView::section {
    background-color: #d4d0c8;
    color: #000000;
    border-right-color: #707070;
    border-bottom-color: #707070;
}

QTableCornerButton::section {
    background-color: #d4d0c8;
    border-color: #707070;
}

/* QCheckBox */
QCheckBox::indicator {
    border-color: #707070;
    background-color: #ffffff;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:checked {
    background-color: #000080;
    border-color: #000080;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:hover {
    border-color: #000080;
}

/* QGroupBox */
/* border-color #707070 (지침 초안 #808080에서 상향): 배경 #d4d0c8 대비 2.568:1 -> 3.220:1
   (계산: tasks/S-022 스크립트 패턴, 실측값은 이 파일 상단 대비 표 참고). */
QGroupBox {
    border-color: #707070;
}

QGroupBox::title, QLabel[class="section-title"] {
    color: #000080;
}

QLabel[class="hint-text"],
QLabel[class="about-version"],
QLabel[class="about-copyright"] {
    color: #505050;
}

QLabel[class="file-path-box"] {
    color: #505050;
    border-color: #707070;
    background-color: #ffffff;
}

/* QStatusBar */
QStatusBar {
    background-color: #d4d0c8;
    color: #000000;
    border-top-color: #707070;
}

/* QMenu */
QMenuBar {
    background-color: #d4d0c8;
    color: #000000;
}
QMenuBar::item:selected {
    background-color: #000080;
    color: #ffffff;
}

QMenu {
    background-color: #d4d0c8;
    border-color: #707070;
}

QMenu::item:selected {
    background-color: #000080;
    color: #ffffff;
}

/* QToolBar */
QToolBar {
    background-color: #d4d0c8;
    border-bottom-color: #707070;
}

QToolBar QToolButton:hover {
    background-color: #c8c4bc;
}

QToolBar QToolButton:pressed {
    background-color: #b8b4ac;
}

/* ==================================================================================
   Custom Buttons & States (Accent, Danger, Warning, Connected)
   ================================================================================== */

/* Accent - Save, Start (색 값은 light 테마 계열과 공유 - 의미 인식 일관성)
   S-063: 흰 글씨가 밝은 녹 배경(#4CAF50/#66BB6A)에서 대비 미달(2.78/2.36)이라
   어두운 글씨(#1b1b1b)로 전환. pressed는 배경을 #1B5E20으로 낮춰 흰 글씨 유지
   (어두운 배경엔 밝은 글씨가 자연스럽다 - dracula 사례와 동일 원칙). disabled
   글씨는 이 파일 팔레트에 이미 있는 "connected status label" 색 #1b5e20 재사용. */
QPushButton[class="accent"] {
    background-color: #4CAF50;
    border-color: #388E3C;
    color: #1b1b1b;
}

QPushButton[class="accent"]:hover {
    background-color: #66BB6A;
    border-color: #2E7D32;
}

QPushButton[class="accent"]:pressed {
    background-color: #1B5E20;
    color: #ffffff;
}

QPushButton[class="accent"]:disabled {
    background-color: #A5D6A7;
    border-color: #81C784;
    color: #1b5e20;
}

/* Danger - Stop, Delete
   S-063: 흰 글씨 배경 대비가 미달(normal 3.68/hover 3.49)이라 배경을 한 단계씩
   낮춤(normal→#C62828, hover→#D32F2F, pressed→#B71C1C). 글씨는 흰색 유지. */
QPushButton[class="danger"] {
    background-color: #C62828;
    border-color: #D32F2F;
    color: #ffffff;
}

QPushButton[class="danger"]:hover {
    background-color: #D32F2F;
    border-color: #C62828;
}

QPushButton[class="danger"]:pressed {
    background-color: #B71C1C;
}

QPushButton[class="danger"]:disabled {
    background-color: #EF9A9A;
    border-color: #E57373;
    color: #7f0000;
}

/* Warning - Pause
   S-063: pressed 배경이 실수로 danger 톤(#B71C1C)이었던 것을 warning 계열 어두운
   주황(#FF6F00)으로 교정 - 기존 검정 글씨(#000000)로 대비 확보(7.53). disabled도
   글씨색 교체(1.22→16.24). normal/hover(#000000)는 이미 기준 충족이라 유지. */
QPushButton[class="warning"] {
    background-color: #FFC107;
    border-color: #FFD740;
    color: #000000;
}

QPushButton[class="warning"]:hover {
    background-color: #FFD740;
    border-color: #FFEA00;
}

QPushButton[class="warning"]:pressed {
    background-color: #FF6F00;
}

QPushButton[class="warning"]:disabled {
    background-color: #FFE082;
    border-color: #FFD54F;
    color: #000000;
}

/* Port States */
QPushButton[state="connected"] {
    background-color: #4CAF50;
    border-color: #388E3C;
    color: #ffffff;
}

QPushButton[state="connected"]:hover {
    background-color: #66BB6A;
    border-color: #2E7D32;
}

QPushButton[state="disconnected"] {
    background-color: #d4d0c8;
    border-color: #707070;
    color: #000000;
}

QPushButton[state="disconnected"]:hover {
    background-color: #c8c4bc;
    border-color: #505050;
}

QPushButton[state="error"] {
    background-color: #F44336;
    border-color: #D32F2F;
    color: #ffffff;
}

QPushButton[state="error"]:hover {
    background-color: #EF5350;
    border-color: #C62828;
}

/* Recording (REC) State */
QPushButton[state="recording"]:checked {
    background-color: #ffcdd2;
    color: #b71c1c;
}

/* Port Status Dot (StatusBar) */
QLabel[state="connected"] {
    color: #1b5e20;
    font-weight: bold;
}

QLabel[state="disconnected"] {
    color: #616161;
    font-weight: bold;
}

/* Danger Progress (Buffer Overflow / Transfer Failure) */
QProgressBar[state="danger"]::chunk {
    background-color: #F44336;
}

/* Disabled States */
QComboBox:disabled {
    background-color: #cac6be;
    color: #6d6d6d;
    border-color: #a8a4a0;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:disabled {
    background-color: #cac6be;
    border-color: #a8a4a0;
}

QTabBar::tab:disabled {
    background-color: #cac6be;
    color: #6d6d6d;
}
